<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to May 29 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to May 29 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in the Eurobond and related markets rose to $922.46 billion in the week to May 29 from $866.82 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association figures show (in billions of dollars).</p>
<p>					 Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		    59.97		50.44</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    27.46		26.50</p>
<p> Secondary market:		 862.49	     816.38</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues   209.32	     218.89</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear     670.59	     632.30</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	   225.88	     234.52</p>
</text>
